# .kit-owned — the files this kit owns and refreshes on `scripts/upgrade`. Everything else in a
# knowledge base is the base's own and is never overwritten: the charter, the schema, the roles,
# the style additions, the ignore additions, and of course notes.md, log.md, wiki/ and raw/.
#
# One path per line, relative to the KB root. A trailing slash means every file beneath it.
# The kit reads this list from the NEW version during an upgrade, so a later kit can take
# ownership of a file it did not ship before.
AGENTS.md
STYLE.md
.gitignore
.ingestignore
.kit-owned
.claude/
scripts/
raw/README.md
inbox/README.md
junk/README.md
